`p_days` 1 is the rolling 24 hours: `now() - make_interval(days => p_days)`, the same window as 7, 30 and 90 days. It is not the previous Perth calendar day. The public wrapper is unchanged. Karratha `karratha135_usage.report_usage` is unchanged.

